{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26880","headline":"题长安薛员外水阁 · 姚合","name":"题长安薛员外水阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭亭新阁成，风景益鲜明。\n石尽太湖色，水多湘渚声。\n翠筠和粉长，零露逐荷倾。\n时倚高窗望，幽寻小径行。\n林疎看鸟语，池近识鱼情。\n政暇招闲客，唯将酒送迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}